WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:03.790
[Music]

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:25.799
[Music]

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:29.390
we were hunters and foragers the

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:29.390
frontier was everywhere

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:42.810
we were bounded only by the earth and

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:48.108
the ocean and the sky

00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:48.109
[Music]

00:00:48.809 --> 00:00:57.030
the open road still softly calls like a

00:00:53.129 --> 00:01:00.210
nearly forgotten song of childhood for

00:00:57.030 --> 00:01:04.049
all our failings despite our limitations

00:01:00.210 --> 00:01:06.860
and fallibilities we humans are capable

00:01:04.049 --> 00:01:09.360
of greatness

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:13.060
[Music]

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:17.580
how far will our nomadic species have

00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:17.580
wandered by the end of the next century

00:01:17.730 --> 00:01:21.210
and the next millennium

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:27.030
[Music]

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:54.939
[Music]

